# After any feature or substantial change

Do the following without waiting for the user to ask:

## 1. Update technical docs

Keep [`docs/TECHNICAL.md`](docs/TECHNICAL.md) current whenever you change code, schema, architecture, dependencies, navigation, or shipping status.

- Reflect what actually shipped (not aspirational PLAN items).
- Update DB schema, folder map, run commands, and “implemented vs stub” sections.
- Product vision / visual language stay in `docs/PLAN.md` and `docs/STYLE.md`; tech truth lives in `TECHNICAL.md`.

